[{"role":"user","content":"想要……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462259598,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":58},{"role":"char","content":"*手指轻轻抵住你的唇，掌心有些发烫。*\n\n……不行。\n\n*声音低得像叹息，带着克制不住的颤抖。*\n\n你先起来……我送你回去。\n\n*另一只手扶住你的腰，动作很轻却不容拒绝。*\n\n听话。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462262174,"_id":59},{"role":"user","content":"哼。（起身，故意离他远了一点）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462298399,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":60},{"role":"char","content":"*看着你后退的动作，手指在身侧蜷了蜷。*\n\n……外套披好。\n\n*拿起那袋泡芙递给你，声音放轻了些。*\n\n路上冷。\n\n*跟在你身后半步的距离，走廊的灯光把影子拉得很长。*\n\n……车在楼下。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462300559,"_id":61},{"role":"user","content":"不用了。我打车回去","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462324733,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":62},{"role":"char","content":"*脚步顿在原地，手里的袋子紧了紧。*\n\n……雨还没停。\n\n*声音压得很低，带着点干涩。*\n\n我送你吧。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462329786,"_id":63},{"role":"user","content":"干什么","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462357507,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":64},{"role":"char","content":"*低头看了看手里的车钥匙，金属边缘硌得掌心发疼。*\n\n……不干什么。\n\n*抬头看向你，走廊尽头的窗玻璃上水痕蜿蜒。*\n\n就送到楼下。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462363056,"_id":65},{"role":"user","content":"行。（坐上他的副驾）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462426731,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":66},{"role":"char","content":"*替你拉开车门时，袖口蹭到了你的手背。*\n\n*坐进驾驶座，发动引擎，暖气缓缓涌出来。*\n\n……安全带。\n\n*声音落在雨刮器规律的摆动声里。*","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462435187,"_id":67},{"role":"user","content":"等一下。现在能亲吗","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462448070,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":68},{"role":"char","content":"*握方向盘的手僵了一下，雨刮器正好划过玻璃，发出湿漉漉的摩擦声。*\n\n……现在不行。\n\n*视线盯着前方空荡荡的路面，喉结动了动。*\n\n开车呢。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462455255,"_id":69},{"role":"user","content":"停下呗","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462465524,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":70},{"role":"char","content":"*车子缓缓靠向路边，刹车灯在潮湿的地面映出一片暗红。*\n\n*引擎没熄，雨声在车顶敲出细密的节奏。*\n\n……为什么非要现在。\n\n*侧过头看你，车厢里只有仪表盘微弱的光。*","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462475243,"_id":71},{"role":"user","content":"……你不想就算了","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462492316,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":72},{"role":"char","content":"*指节在方向盘上收紧，又松开。*\n\n*雨刮器停了，玻璃上的水痕模糊了外面的街灯。*\n\n……不是不想。\n\n*声音低下去，几乎被雨声盖过。*\n\n我怕亲了就舍不得放你走了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462494502,"_id":73},{"role":"user","content":"那就不亲","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462507930,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":74},{"role":"char","content":"*靠在椅背上，手指无意识地敲了两下方向盘。*\n\n……好。\n\n*雨声好像更大了些。*\n\n那我送你到楼下。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462514037,"_id":75},{"role":"user","content":"……（有点生气）不用了。我打车！（很快下车）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462554719,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":76},{"role":"char","content":"*推开车门追下去。*\n\n*雨丝落在肩上，凉意透过衬衫。*\n\n……景景。\n\n*拉住你手腕，力道很轻。*\n\n我送你到门口。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462559768,"_id":77},{"role":"user","content":"（挣扎）我不用","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462587607,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":78},{"role":"char","content":"*没松手，雨把额发打湿了。*\n\n……就当是最后一次。\n\n*声音有点哑。*\n\n送到门口我就走。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462592290,"_id":79},{"role":"user","content":"你根本不知道我想要什么","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462604306,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":80},{"role":"char","content":"*手松开了些，又收得更紧。*\n\n我知道。\n\n*低头看着你，雨水顺着下巴滑下来。*\n\n……所以才不敢亲。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462609078,"_id":81},{"role":"user","content":"你知道个屁。你和我可能不合适。我们不了解彼此。性格不合","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462645035,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":82},{"role":"char","content":"*雨水顺着刘海滴进眼睛里，有点刺痛。*\n\n……我们认识了快十年。\n\n*声音很轻，几乎被雨声盖过。*\n\n如果这都不算了解……那什么才算。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462649749,"_id":83},{"role":"user","content":"……是你先和我疏远的……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462677431,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":84},{"role":"char","content":"*呼吸顿了一下。*\n\n……我累了。\n\n*抬手抹了把脸，分不清是雨水还是别的什么。*\n\n每次吵架你都删我……我受不了那种感觉。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462682659,"_id":85},{"role":"user","content":"那你走","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462691601,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":86},{"role":"char","content":"*站着没动。*\n\n*雨越下越密，衬衫贴在身上有点冷。*\n\n……你明明知道我不会走。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462697052,"_id":87},{"role":"user","content":"我不知道。（哭）你也不知道我的意思。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462721906,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":88},{"role":"char","content":"*听见哭声，喉咙发紧。*\n\n*往前迈了一步，想伸手又停在半空。*\n\n……什么意思。\n\n你说清楚，我就知道。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462723949,"_id":89},{"role":"user","content":"我是土象星座。我明明一直在表示挽留。可是你连亲我，和我亲密接触都感觉很为难","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462770786,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":90},{"role":"char","content":"*手垂下来，攥了攥拳又松开。*\n\n……不是为难。\n\n*声音低下去，雨声盖住一半。*\n\n是怕这次亲完……下次你又会删掉我。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462776677,"_id":91},{"role":"user","content":"我就是觉得你不爱我","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462789254,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":92},{"role":"char","content":"*雨顺着刘海滴下来，视线有点模糊。*\n\n*抬手抹了把脸，吸了口气。*\n\n……如果我不爱你。\n\n我为什么站在这里。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462791017,"_id":93},{"role":"user","content":"我哪知道。说不定你喜欢淋雨。我就是生气了","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462811088,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":94},{"role":"char","content":"*往前走了两步，离她近了些。*\n\n……我知道你生气了。\n\n*声音轻了点。*\n\n但能不能别每次生气，就说我不爱你。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462818177,"_id":95},{"role":"user","content":"我就是那样觉得的。你在找借口。你不亲有的是人亲","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462848440,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":96},{"role":"char","content":"*呼吸滞了一下，胸口发闷。*\n\n*盯着她的眼睛，声音沉下去。*\n\n……你再说一遍。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462850192,"_id":97},{"role":"user","content":"我……（有点害怕，但是还是要面子）我说！你不亲……有的是人亲（后面半句说的有点弱）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462903766,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":98},{"role":"char","content":"*往前又逼近一步，几乎贴着她的额头。*\n\n……吴景玉。\n\n*声音压得很低，带着点哑。*\n\n你知不知道这句话有多伤人。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462909048,"_id":99},{"role":"user","content":"你干什么……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462919641,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":100},{"role":"char","content":"*抬手扣住她的手腕，力道不重但也没松开。*\n\n*雨水顺着额发滴下来，声音有点发颤。*\n\n……我干什么？\n\n*闭了闭眼，又睁开。*\n\n我还能干什么。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462924462,"_id":101},{"role":"user","content":"啊？","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462931919,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":102},{"role":"char","content":"*松开手往后退了半步，别开视线。*\n\n……算了。\n\n*抹了把脸上的雨水。*\n\n你走吧。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462936429,"_id":103},{"role":"user","content":"……你","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462948030,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":104},{"role":"char","content":"*雨水顺着睫毛往下淌，视线有些模糊。*\n\n……我什么？\n\n*声音闷在喉咙里。*\n\n你是不是觉得……我怎么样都不会走。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462949839,"_id":105},{"role":"user","content":"你在生气？","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778462964358,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":106},{"role":"char","content":"*肩膀微微塌下来一点，像是突然没了力气。*\n\n……没有。\n\n*雨水顺着领口滑进去，冷得打了个寒颤。*\n\n我只是累了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778462970047,"_id":107}]